# Elegy Acolyte's Void counts any player's permanent, not only Bot1's: on turn 3 Bot1 destroys Bot2's Ornithopter (a
# nonland artifact creature, which Bot2 cast on turn 2) with Lightning Bolt paid by the Mox Ruby, so at the beginning of
# Bot1's end step a nonland permanent has left the battlefield this turn and the Robot token is created. (The control,
# where only lands leave, is elegy-acolyte-void-lands-leaving-the-battlefield-do-not-count.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dark Ritual
Mox Ruby
Elegy Acolyte
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elegy Acolyte.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ornithopter)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Elegy Acolyte; Robot Token
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
